Version 1.28.0 — 2026-11-15
Previous GitHub release: v1.27.0 (2026-11-13)

Overview
--------
ZGeo 1.28.0 combines the export actions into one "Export" button
with a choice of Excel or HTML for the complete file-list report.

Changes in 1.28.0
-----------------
- Combined the Excel and HTML export buttons into a single "Export" button at the bottom of the "Files" tab; it opens a menu with Excel and HTML options.
- The HTML report contains the same content as the Excel report:
  - "Files" — the filtered file list with totals;
  - "Statistics" — statistics by format;
  - one section per problem check with issues;
  - "Check statistics" — totals by check.
- The report includes a linked table of contents, sticky table headers,
  scrollable tables and print styles.
- The HTML file is self-contained: no external libraries or internet
  connection are required.
- The selected export dialog uses the `.xlsx` or `.html` extension and opens Explorer with
  the saved file.
- Russian and English interface strings, README, metadata and tests
  were updated.

